    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27548" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίυγρος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>washed out, pale,</i>
			
